# Icons (generated artifacts)

PNG 图标由 `node extension/store/gen-icons.js` 生成（输出 icon16/32/48/128/512.png 到本目录）。
为保持仓库纯文本，未提交二进制图标；clone 后先跑一次生成，再执行 build-store.js / 加载 unpacked 扩展。
{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Synapse",
  "version": "0.15.1",
  "description": "Drive your logged-in browser from an AI agent over a secure local bridge: read pages, fill forms, capture network. No cloud, no telemetry.",
  "minimum_chrome_version": "116",
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "src/background.js"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "debugger",
    "sidePanel",
    "tabs",
    "tabGroups",
    "storage",
    "alarms"
  ],
  "host_permissions": [
    "<all_urls>"
  ],
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "http://localhost/*",
        "http://127.0.0.1/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "src/content.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_end"
    }
  ],
  "side_panel": {
    "default_path": "src/sidepanel/index.html"
  },
  "commands": {
    "_execute_action": {
      "suggested_key": {
        "default": "Ctrl+Shift+Comma",
        "mac": "Command+Shift+Comma"
      }
    },
    "open-wb-cdp-panel": {
      "description": "Open Synapse side panel"
    }
  },
  "action": {
    "default_title": "Synapse",
    "default_icon": {
      "16": "icons/icon16.png",
      "24": "icons/icon16.png",
      "32": "icons/icon32.png",
      "48": "icons/icon48.png",
      "128": "icons/icon128.png"
    }
  },
  "icons": {
    "16": "icons/icon16.png",
    "32": "icons/icon32.png",
    "48": "icons/icon48.png",
    "128": "icons/icon128.png"
  }
}
